## The village's Peeplets: fifty of them, each a name, a coat (an index into
## PeepletPalette.BODY), a hat (a HeadgearItemFactory kind, "" for none),
## eyewear (an EyewearItemFactory kind, "" for none), two traits and one
## line of who they are. Who Ate the Pie?'s bakers are dealt from here
## (puzzles/pie_gen.gd), and the persona page renders every one through
## ui/peeplet_view.gd (tests/_shot_peeplet_personas.gd).
##
## No two share both a coat and a hat, so a day's twenty never holds two
## that read alike; names are five letters at most, for the bakers' cards.
## The traits and lines are the cast's notes, not shown in the game yet:
## put them in locale rows before they reach the screen.
##
## A saved day keeps its bakers by index into this list: append only.

